{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01GQvkjtvksQpsbnLFgjk4GF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see many SPIRAL-related files modified, not site/src/proxy.ts. Let me check what the actual issue was. Let me understand the story better by looking at the acceptance criteria again and understanding what needs to be done:\n\nAcceptance Criteria:\n1. Vercel Edge Config store created and connected to the project ✅ (needs to be created in dashboard, not code)\n2. @vercel/edge-config and @vercel/flags packages installed ✅ (already installed)\n3. A/B flag defined for /book page primary CTA copy ✅ (flags.ts exists)\n4. Flag evaluated in Next.js Middleware and variant cookie set ✅ (middleware.ts exists)\n5. GA4 custom dimension records which variant each session received for statistical analysis ⚠️ (needs to be done)\n6. Vercel Flags UI in dashboard shows flag status (needs setup in dashboard)\n\nThe problem with the oversized diff was likely that the implementation tried to do too much or had side effects. Let me now understand what's missing:\n\n1. The middleware.ts is already created (at site/src/middleware.ts)\n2. The flags.ts is already created\n3. What's missing is GA4 integration to record the variant\n\nLet me check the instrumentation-client.ts or analytics setup to see where GA4 is configured, and what needs to be added there.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":867,"cache_read_input_tokens":67191,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":867},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a0509890-c56d-430e-b350-61a2b3042ba1","uuid":"95971b4a-6807-4ee9-8d9a-3e7a14d5d373"}
